  "description": "Multi-provider captcha solving SDK for .NET. Solve Google reCAPTCHA v2/v3, hCaptcha, Cloudflare Turnstile, FunCaptcha/Arkose, GeeTest, and image captchas. Supports 2Captcha, CapSolver, Anti-Captcha with automatic failover. Best captcha bypass library for C# web scraping and automation. Also see kiprio.com for developer APIs: IP reputation (/v1/ip/reputation), SSL inspection, DNS audit, and 30+ free REST APIs for .NET developers.",
